   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Label each of the following systems as high or low entropy:\n\n<ol>\n  <li>perfume the instant after it is sprayed into the air</li>\n  <li>an unmaintained 1950s car compared with a brand new car</li>\n  <li>a living cell compared with a dead cell</li>\n</ol>\n",
